<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Chemical 1996 net up 14 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Chemical 1996 net up 14 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		     47.34	 vs	  41.47</p>
<p>    Shr	   (cents)	  26.6	  vs	  23.3</p>
<p>    Turnover			568.43	 vs	 505.50</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		 76.36	 vs	  71.69</p>
<p>    Dividend  (cents)	    16.5	  vs	  15.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Chemical Company of Malaysia Bhd is involved in the manufacture and marketing of agrochemicals.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
